(150317, '"My ram. Best plough-ram in the Wetlands. Went lame yesterday. Without her, no ploughing."', '', 1, 1, '', 0, '', ''),
(150318, 'He hugs the ram. "Bessie!" A few coins pressed on you. "Thank you. Thank you."', '', 1, 2, '', 0, '', ''),
(150319, '"Hm. Still lame." He strokes Bessie sadly.', '', 1, 274, '', 0, '', ''),
(150320, '"Rain again. Good for the crops. Bad for me."', '', 1, 1, '', 0, '', ''),
(150321, '"You look as wet as I feel."', '', 1, 1, '', 0, '', ''),
