(802, 5, 'Brakk. Did you see anything last night?', '', 0, 807, 807, '', 'askedwho', '', 1),
(802, 6, 'You said your frost-ink glows blue in the cold. So why is Nim''s satchel glowing?', '', 0, 810, 810, '', 'ink,glow', '', 0),
