-- Brother Marrow: every graveyard's spirit healer is a robed skeleton who raises the dead (dnd_loader.cpp
-- npc_dnd_marrow) - for a little silver from a living friend, or free when a ghost comes to him. Seen by the living
-- and the dead alike (type flag 2), no spirit-healer flag (no WoW resurrection), undead (never a townsfolk talker)
